{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]We give Thee [C]but [D7]Thine [G]own,
[G7]What[C]e’er [G]the [Am]gift [A#dim6]may[Dsus]be;[D]
All [G]that we [C]have [D7]is [Em]Thine [D]a[G]lone,
[G7]A[Am]trust, O [G]Lord, [D7]from [G]Thee.
{end_of_verse}
